      "lineIndex": 35,
      "gurmukhi": "ਰਿਪੁ ਨਾਥ ਚਰ ਪਤਿ ਰਾਖੁ ॥",
      "transliteration": "rip naath char pat raakh ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਫਿਰ) 'ਰਿਪੁ ਨਾਥ ਚਰ ਪਤਿ' ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 777,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "रिपु नाथ चर पति राखु ॥",
