      "transliteration": "nadhee raaT sut bhagan bhanijai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਨਦੀ ਰਾਟ ਸੁਤ ਭਗਣਿ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 777,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नदी राट सुत भगणि भणिजै ॥",
