      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਸ ਦੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਪਰ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਬਖਾਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 777,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद तिह अंति बखानहु ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108723",
      "sourceShabadId": "9577",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0777_line_0042",
      "lineIndex": 42,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਭ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਨਾਮ ਤੁਪਕ ਅਨੁਮਾਨਹੁ ॥੯੯੦॥",
      "transliteration": "sabh sree naam tupak anumaanahu ||990||",
      "translation": "Saying the words “Nadi-raat, sut-bhagini”, utter the words “Jaachar-pati-shatru” and know the names of Tupak.990.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਭ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਅਨੁਮਾਨੋ ॥੯੯੦॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 777,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सभ स्री नाम तुपक अनुमानहु ॥९९०॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108724",
      "sourceShabadId": "9577",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0777_line_0043",
      "lineIndex": 43,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਾਮੁੰਦ੍ਰਜ ਕਹਿ ਭਗਣਿ ਭਣਿਜੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "saamu(n)dhraj keh bhagan bhanijai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਸਾਮੁੰਦ੍ਰਜ (ਚੰਦ੍ਰਮਾ) ਭਗਣਿ' ਕਹੋ।",
