      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0777_line_0046",
      "lineIndex": 46,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਾਮ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਸਭ ਜੀਅ ਧਾਰੋ ॥੯੯੧॥",
      "transliteration": "naam tupak ke sabh jeea dhaaro ||991||",
      "translation": "Saying “Samudraj”, add the word “Bhagini”, then utter the words “Jaachar-pati-shatru” and in this way know all the names of Tupak in your mind.991.",
