      "transliteration": "jaa char keh pat padh dhe ddaaro ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਫਿਰ) 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਪਤਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 777,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर कहि पति पद दे डारो ॥",
